The river is the 6♥, and you checked. The dealer checks behind you, so we go to showdown. The dealer's 4♠ and 5♦ make a six-high straight with the 2♣, 3♦ and 6♥, which beats your A-high. The dealer takes the 60 pot. Your bankroll is now 960: the 10 blind and the 20 flop bet are gone. (The earlier bankroll figure didn't reflect the flop bet, so I've corrected it here.)

